#: badend2:badend2_E81EC2ED_7A6F_4E49_B697_9FCC7EC85082
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c8785603cc3b559a70be383c16f50ceb1bad3e64c450602c25cedf6be34f0e6
#. default-sha256: 4c9be276fa33185f1b81e8cef50be2cf59d8019025a4a762d828360520c67816
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_E81EC2ED_7A6F_4E49_B697_9FCC7EC85082"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫You⟪k:21⟫The Departed⟪k:22⟫ could not accept the Maid’s offer."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫——不可能接受。"

#: badend2:badend2_33A5723D_E91F_4B4B_B3E7_29178B387314
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1044945929473c804f8073a2c54238fe125b204b88be3471050205d046ba0849
#. default-sha256: 42c22decce055e2e2402813d1c1a3364e45df683f68bcf173b7a2eec36ebddcc
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_33A5723D_E91F_4B4B_B3E7_29178B387314"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If what she said was true, ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫he⟪k:3⟫ could not give up on ⟪k:4⟫Your⟪k:5⟫his⟪k:6⟫ "
"search."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫就算这些都是真的，⟪k:1⟫「⟪k:2⟫你⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫死者⟪k:5⟫」也不想就此放弃。"

#: badend2:badend2_80517542_50EF_4845_B1BE_3B78A8E57242
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 09ea15df150c4c000a4e59969aee09ed8659c020ab4a8085439402d756290268
#. default-sha256: f6e0afa9618ace31f7c42552f7f900b18ab081001fb2d66d4ba9bda383a57c8d
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_80517542_50EF_4845_B1BE_3B78A8E57242"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫He⟪k:3⟫ had spent years and years waiting to reunite with someone.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫Your⟪k:7⟫His⟪k:8⟫ previous attempts may have been rife with mistakes,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫「⟪k:1⟫你⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫死者⟪k:4⟫」是为了再次遇见某人，⟪k:5⟫才会轮回着这些漫长的岁月。⟪k:6⟫即使一"
"次次的错过，⟪k:7⟫也没有关系……"

#: badend2:badend2_155BDA4C_4B1C_4162_82A2_B7C905A6F03B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3168c024a501e4f74b79c0a4a2319f4478a07bd0f8185cb6eb95c9c22e29ebe7
#. default-sha256: e8425141300caf311224c2ef6ddd0d797deb89ba66f6e927e7e8040a310cf7f3
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_155BDA4C_4B1C_4162_82A2_B7C905A6F03B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫he⟪k:3⟫ could not stop trying."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫下一次，⟪k:1⟫一定能得以实现。"

#: badend2:badend2_FC3E3AEE_F43B_4252_95DB_D3633CE93C81
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87bb13c31d18f77c98fc3ed48fb69c1f5ac889d040b077888f83614d2356d8c6
#. default-sha256: c659257925e5e85689d303ad3c6c56eba3fdac7c98c8b9e89bf10eb2702d46e4
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_FC3E3AEE_F43B_4252_95DB_D3633CE93C81"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Come, Master. ⟪k:3⟫Spend eternity with me in the mansion.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫We will have "
"the most wonderful time together."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫那么……老爷。⟪k:3⟫与下仆一起，⟪k:4⟫在馆内度过余生吧。⟪k:5⟫接下来的日子想必会非常愉快"
"吧……"

#: badend2:badend2_60B37471_CF71_4582_AC06_A3A0CD0EBC0D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5aec27f2ed08662cb6f25e79c452d155e8abba0d85fa05fe8dfb5fd5ffa8873e
#. default-sha256: c95a2af3fc6bdd5cb59b8c8cfad85ea816ed4b4c017fe2a6d2a499a6469a4bef
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_60B37471_CF71_4582_AC06_A3A0CD0EBC0D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫These were all terrifying now."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫女仆甜美的声音。⟪k:1⟫寒冷的指尖。⟪k:2⟫坚冰一样的微笑。⟪k:3⟫所有这些，⟪k:4⟫现在都让人感到无比"
"恐惧。"

#: badend2:badend2_E920478E_380D_40E0_9D6F_C1D5F3F22207
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e0dc0efa068b12ae1cd7dcee03b6950496a17145247a52c257a7e918529ba7c
#. default-sha256: 1971697c9f454640c9001764f08d332fd85225598646fd3e15842ad886aa729f
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_E920478E_380D_40E0_9D6F_C1D5F3F22207"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫The Departed⟪k:3⟫ had to escape."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……必须要逃离这里。"

#: badend2:badend2_BEEAD61C_6656_4F1B_916B_4AB6BF25FD13
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da5e3f9579b0614d82a215dc1ebb477711b26be2e567b2fbf8fd017309124286
#. default-sha256: 668d2cb14f36cac9cad75c4a14cf0293e58fc58113ab675563af242a4c4ba4ca
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_BEEAD61C_6656_4F1B_916B_4AB6BF25FD13"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Had to break out of this darkness, make it outside."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫离开这个暗无天日之地，⟪k:1⟫去到外面的世界……"

#: badend2:badend2_DCAE5A81_0F95_44CE_96DD_DCE8DF36E8FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 210d4aa12fb8d091fcbec2e4f1ff452e69adf1f2c696424f437e1d4eef7f68a6
#. default-sha256: 5b46ddc88ac269c0d60dacf612ea6c49a0c05b325c587128f101ac005d0f0f37
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_DCAE5A81_0F95_44CE_96DD_DCE8DF36E8FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Master? ⟪k:3⟫What is the—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫老爷……？  ⟪k:3⟫您怎么了——"

#: badend2:badend2_7D4AC5A9_92B5_4EB0_8126_EE36DAD7F283
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4204c5019a34c284acbf3985623f06ce20f3afd7c0ab9b4d81dfff78238603e3
#. default-sha256: 209aeb31d86e1b649e1e13483db4ee49b83907ae26fb7683c0c3fa60643e524a
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_7D4AC5A9_92B5_4EB0_8126_EE36DAD7F283"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You⟪k:4⟫He⟪k:5⟫ brushed the Maid’s hand aside.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫As her eyes widened, "
"aghast, ⟪k:8⟫You⟪k:9⟫he⟪k:10⟫ fled from the observation tower."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「⟪k:3⟫你⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫死者⟪k:6⟫」甩开了她的手。⟪k:7⟫冷冷斜视着一脸错愕的女仆，⟪k:8⟫随"
"即退离了瞭望塔的阁楼。"

#: badend2:badend2_A3A19873_9FF8_4F6D_ABA1_EB8E9A7EEE89
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a05f4d6dd1d7722e54f9755190fc5e8bbf8ddcd35f1fdb38233aeea5d3771ce
#. default-sha256: 2df0b036a56f8b501376454e28376ff998782200f7b09a55ebc0be00be2720c3
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_A3A19873_9FF8_4F6D_ABA1_EB8E9A7EEE89"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Down and down the spiral staircase ⟪k:3⟫You⟪k:4⟫he⟪k:5⟫ went, though not a whisper "
"of a footstep could be heard in the stone tower. ⟪k:6⟫The stairs seemed to go on forever."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫沿着望不到尽头的阶梯，⟪k:3⟫不停地向下。⟪k:4⟫耳边听不到拍打在地面的脚步声。⟪k:5⟫唯一"
"能感觉到的，⟪k:6⟫只有永恒不变地——"

#: badend2:badend2_1971F44F_273D_4E0B_A285_3EB8D4B69B09
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 513c56b5f268c759cdf8b0db08c58640295a513806e26f214a46e77755379356
#. default-sha256: a02314f01d5d639748a21610f872e435c1e96acb30ccd406b1b80e49506fc164
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_1971F44F_273D_4E0B_A285_3EB8D4B69B09"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Down and down and down and down..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫向下、⟪k:1⟫向下、⟪k:2⟫向下、⟪k:3⟫向下……"

#: badend2:badend2_71CD261B_E4FB_441E_A0DB_71E9AB756C0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 555891de15b9a018a26ae7bf3416383cbc1818dff7820f65212568fe06b928bc
#. default-sha256: 192d9ff7b5730d571d9252cbfe59e74094e7c695725c52f99833b72e70834e4c
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_71CD261B_E4FB_441E_A0DB_71E9AB756C0C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫At long last, ⟪k:3⟫You⟪k:4⟫the Departed⟪k:5⟫ arrived at the bottom, dashing from "
"the next room without a passing glance at the angel in the stained-glass window."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫终于来到了彩绘玻璃的房间。⟪k:3⟫「⟪k:4⟫你⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫死者⟪k:7⟫」没有转头看一眼天使的浮"
"绘，⟪k:8⟫而是直接穿了过去。"

#: badend2:badend2_9452EA81_98F8_424E_9759_125A43BC5142
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f307ae572fd096e3b9b89c8f2131a3efc2245178837dc65c5e9c2a749dbd4019
#. default-sha256: d0c6872f87a2968ff1dd32f6297b81b4defee137694f7d28751bfd6ac4d98741
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_9452EA81_98F8_424E_9759_125A43BC5142"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫The Maid had shown ⟪k:9⟫You⟪k:10⟫him⟪k:11⟫ around "
"the mansion, so ⟪k:12⟫You⟪k:13⟫he⟪k:14⟫ knew its layout."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫「⟪k:9⟫你⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫死者⟪k:12⟫」清楚地记得被女仆引导"
"时走过的路。⟪k:13⟫所以，⟪k:14⟫对这栋馆的构造已谙熟于心。"

#: badend2:badend2_3B6AC469_BC72_4416_B5FE_CBF87F7C49E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f466ceb60a60c9e61e5d9b0f31e1666739be6fba8eaaf3918bf8a9f734ccbf66
#. default-sha256: b1d8f9233aedc9d4e8a8bb45ee94cd376c837633e290b396e11d46f63fde98bb
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_3B6AC469_BC72_4416_B5FE_CBF87F7C49E1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Or perhaps..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫还是说……"

#: badend2:badend2_05B7D727_4E82_4E03_8069_3EAE9DB44E5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b33fcaa06183ce01611310b4e6e99b806763a83094bdb680be460850ebd68c77
#. default-sha256: 0136b238fa0f8d457e9449fd20754f4710ab98d6f139a2d189f9b2b9f7d963ea
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_05B7D727_4E82_4E03_8069_3EAE9DB44E5F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You were⟪k:2⟫he was⟪k:3⟫ familiar with it even before arriving here."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫早在很早之前，⟪k:1⟫就已经了如指掌了呢？"

#: badend2:badend2_4F168C13_B50C_4B17_9524_6828D432A5A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d0139418a844413b406ed528deaa252adfea0c9a18f6aa323ebbf3a4e1702c26
#. default-sha256: 72d3fcd3734bd6a881a91bc14fd4f31033235bd00ad1e1f28a564ebca02d4d94
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_4F168C13_B50C_4B17_9524_6828D432A5A5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A large door came into view. ⟪k:1⟫The exit was up ahead."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫不远处就是出口。⟪k:1⟫此刻，⟪k:2⟫大门正呈现在「⟪k:3⟫你⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫死者⟪k:6⟫」的眼前。"

#: badend2:badend2_2234A750_B2AD_4B18_BBF0_F8962C89636C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c8d6a58fa03334015651fd5ec9a4dd1593697ec8f40372d26dfef425bf43373c
#. default-sha256: 8be21f62aaa1e4bbfb3c9189bb8111789631460bc36695759eb4530fef758715
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_2234A750_B2AD_4B18_BBF0_F8962C89636C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫——老爷。"

#: badend2:badend2_3A6FE51F_0E31_4710_817A_7E3EDCC8F603
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab90ebc33a5f6554586ef9f48d240b37cb765c190326434343d33d6e2ac118f9
#. default-sha256: aff46bbfad859ceda1b252c77f915053438d9631d0c52f9567fa4f57a581d253
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_3A6FE51F_0E31_4710_817A_7E3EDCC8F603"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But the next moment, her voice seized ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫ from behind.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"You⟪k:7⟫The Departed⟪k:8⟫ turned back, and there stood the Maid,⟪k:9⟫wearing the same smile."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫但就在这时。⟪k:1⟫「⟪k:2⟫你⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫死者⟪k:5⟫」的背后，⟪k:6⟫传来女子的声音。⟪k:7⟫回头看到的，"
"⟪k:8⟫是女仆一尘不变的微笑。"

#: badend2:badend2_0D38A2CE_82CE_43BC_B3C8_0FC474C863BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 046dd661f29eff8f93ee2a2158c34428fb73ef2ce1fb44ddd47f421bd6d367f2
#. default-sha256: 79a7d949a0a2f83757ff3173b13515597d12796b32e7a99fedcc47e43a473435
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_0D38A2CE_82CE_43BC_B3C8_0FC474C863BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Where do you think you are going, Master?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I told you, you mustn’t let go "
"of my hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫老爷……您这是要去哪里？⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫这可不行，⟪k:5⟫不能随便放开下仆的手……"

#: badend2:badend2_38309D2C_2E9B_4AC0_A323_3B24BC06066F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f943e950a6002772a083043b6ca1c48a3fbb7ced5a7132d07e129c39b14cde48
#. default-sha256: 76695f024f9d2450645f3d66f8f085c4dc6e24b33d2f34b0c458cb923b1cd226
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_38309D2C_2E9B_4AC0_A323_3B24BC06066F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This mansion is quite large.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You could get lost if you go walking around "
"unaccompanied."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫因为这座宅邸可是非常宽阔的。⟪k:3⟫四处乱走的话，⟪k:4⟫不小心就会迷路呢。"

#: badend2:badend2_1086B956_AF4E_4BBC_A128_A726A1941CE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b9b8dd09a68cccc86d040cd75046bc3a2ecae48b47a41302c7d544c8ec08090
#. default-sha256: cc73cb89a3b18260a50cd770d7e08513b235c27f80571b84e31f99e5d01cbeed
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_1086B956_AF4E_4BBC_A128_A726A1941CE4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Now come, let us head back.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And please do not let go of my hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫来……回来吧。⟪k:2⟫与下仆我一起回去。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫……请务必再也不要放开下仆的手。"

#: badend2:badend2_32069E0C_5B82_40BE_AF52_F88D4A1A9268
